# nexora-action-code: get_version
# Official Huawei NetEngine A816 VRP V8 sample:
# https://support.huawei.com/enterprise/en/doc/EDOC1100400980/55e776e6/troubleshooting-high-cpu-usage
Value Required VRP_VERSION (\S+)
Value Required PRODUCT_VERSION (.+?)
Value Required MODEL (.+?)
Value Required UPTIME (.+?)

Start
  ^VRP\s+\(R\)\s+software,\s+Version\s+${VRP_VERSION}\s+\(${PRODUCT_VERSION}\)\s*$$
  ^(?:HUAWEI|Huawei)\s+${MODEL}\s+uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^Copyright.*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Next
